(3) rescue and firefighting;
(4) emergency planning;
(5) adverse weather operations;
(6) wildlife management;
(7) helideck safety management;
(8) handling of dangerous goods; and
(9) fuel, facilities, storage and handling.
(m) other suitable technical training appropriate to the role and tasks of the personnel.

(a) The operator shall establish and maintain a manual, which is a fundamental requirement for certification.
(b) The manual shall:
(1) reflect the applicable elements and the requirements set out in this part;
